@startuml F4.1f-erro-422-lote
title F4.1f — 422 batch com tipos incompatíveis
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CAAFController" as Ctrl
participant "BatchDecideFormativesUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Aprovar lote misto
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /comissoes/caaf/lote
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT tipos dos ids
Postgres --> UC: tipos mistos
note right of UC
  validação antes do BEGIN TX
  → sem UPDATE
end note
UC --> Ctrl: erro
Ctrl --> WebApp: 422 + invalidIds
WebApp --> Prof: Problem Details

@enduml
